{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_STEAM_GIF01_4x3.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rain98: A lo-fi psycho-thriller romance adventure set in '90s Tokyo.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a chill but dark apartment room, you're joined by Reina Amehara (VA: Rio Tsuchiya), a girl with a mysterious and somewhat dangerous charm to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together, you decide you have to perform a strange ritual... to save the world from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_Steam_GIF02.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There's a charming girl by your side... but she can be a pain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your hard-earned money to keep Reina fed and happy. Especially happy. Under no circumstances is she to be made upset. That would lead to terrible, terrible things happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your days with her will be sweet, bitter, somewhat scary, and always strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_Steam_GIF03.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tokyo at the Turn of the Millennium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Public phones ringing, game arcades beeping, and the neon signs of Shibuya shining through the lukewarm rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse this old city with Reina while you work on your secret ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_Steam_GIF04.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Private Solace in a Dying Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the nostalgic feeling of late '90s Tokyo all alone with Reina through a variety of minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_Steam_GIF05.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Psycho-Thriller Horror Between Reality and Delusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things start feeling off, your memories become foggy, and Reina still holds onto a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is what you see real? Is it your mind playing tricks on you? Tokyo's rain washes the truth away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/RAIN98_Steam_GIF06.gif?t=1744364813\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kick Back with Rain98's Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole range of chill lo-fi tunes will fill your room with nostalgy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with the sound effects of the surrounding environment, they'll transport you straight into the '90s.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498720?t=1744364813","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/804d1b3f26e69ef033d7f755037438637d668abc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744364813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/d7c65d084f365e4e1ee34241dc9e4814dd2ca930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744364813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/d7c65d084f365e4e1ee34241dc9e4814dd2ca930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744364813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contr